    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNestled within the highly sought-after Meadowvale development, this impressive four-bedroom semi-detached residence offers spacious and well-proportioned accommodation ideally suited to modern family living. Situated in The Crescent, a quiet and mature residential enclave, this attractive home combines comfort, convenience, and an excellent location close to the development's play park and tennis courts and all the amenities Arklow has to offer.\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, the property extends to generous living accommodation with bright, airy interiors designed to meet the needs of growing families. The home benefits from mature, fully landscaped, private and maintenance free gardens to the front and rear, off-street parking, and a superb position within the enclave affording it views of the surrounding countryside. Within walking distance of schools, shops, sporting facilities, easy access to the M11 and public transport links, this stunning property represents a wonderful opportunity to acquire a spacious four bedroom semi-detached family home in a prime residential setting.\nViewing is highly recommended and by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 6.28m x 1.82m\nA welcoming entrance hallway providing access to the principal accommodation.\n\nLiving Room - 6.47m x 3.78m\nA spacious and light-filled reception room featuring a large picture window and stunning marble fireplace, solid timber floors. Provides ample space for relaxation and entertaining.\n\nKitchen - 5.69m x 4.48m\nThe heart of the home, this open-plan kitchen and dining space provides excellent storage in the beautifully crafted walnut kitchen units and ample work surfaces. Together with generous dining space and direct access to the rear garden via the double doors, it is ideal for family life and entertaining.\n\nGuest WC - 2.15m x 0.70m\nPractical utility area with additional storage and laundry facilities, together with a convenient ground-floor cloakroom\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.66m x 3.27m\nA generous double bedroom with fitted wardrobes, timber floors, large window overlooking the green area opposite and access to the ensuite bathroom.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.93m x 1.46m\nFully tiled with walk in corner shower unit, vanity wash hand basin and WC.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.05m x 2.98m\nSpacious double bedroom to the rear with excellent natural light and fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.05m x 2.98m\nWell-proportioned double bedroom, also to the rear with fitted wardrobes, for family members or guests.\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.90m x 2.33m\nFlexible accommodation ideal as a bedroom, nursery, home office, study or a walk in wardrobe/dressing room.\n\nBathroom - 2.06m x 1.92m\nFully fitted family bathroom with bath, wash hand basin and WC, serving the first-floor accommodation\n\nGarden - \nTo the front, the property benefits from a private driveway providing off-street parking. The walled maintenance free, rear garden offers a safe and secure space for children to play, outdoor dining, and summer entertaining.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Services: Mains Gas fired Central Heating, Mains water & sewerage.</li><li></li><li> Spacious four-bedroom semi-detached residence</li><li> Sought after residential location with a park and tennis court locate directly across from the property. </li><li> Mature, landscaped, maintenance free rear garden. </li><li> Walled driveway to the front.</li><li> Bright and well-maintained accommodation throughout</li><li> Master bedroom with ensuite shower room.</li><li> Large kitchen/dining area.</li><li> Utility room and guest WC</li><li> Private rear garden</li><li> Off-street parking</li><li> Walking distance to schools, shops, and local amenities</li><li> Easy access to M11 motorway and rail services</li><li> Ideal family home or investment opportunity</ul>"
      },
      {
